UnrealSPADCam
=============

This Unreal plugin (frame capture, GPU readback, TCP streaming, the
UActorComponent) is original to this repository and is offered under the MIT
terms below. It does NOT contain the SPAD sensor model.

The SPAD sensor model — photon-flux estimation, Poisson photon arrivals and
binary thresholding — lives in the ROS component `component_spad_camera`, which
ports spadSim by David Rodriguez-Martinez and carries spadSim's MIT license and
attribution there:

    Upstream: https://github.com/drodriguezSRL/spadSim
    spadSim is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2025 David Rodriguez-Martinez.

Related work (from the spadSim repository):

    "Fast Vision in the Dark: A Case for Single-Photon Imaging in Planetary
    Navigation", arXiv:2510.10597.


